# Build artifacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Runtime-generated game data (not source)
/save.bin
/saves/
/run_history.log
/profile.ron
# The arena's default report path — a measurement, not source. Scenarios in
# `dev-arenas/` are checked in; what one run of them said is not.
/arena-report.ron
# Battle telemetry, written only under `FERAL_DEV_LOG`. The log is a
# measurement; `dev-logs/README.md` is the schema and stays checked in.
/dev-logs/*.jsonl

# Editor/IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# OS cruft
.DS_Store

# AI assistant tooling/config (local, not shared project content)
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.junie/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.superpowers/
.claude/settings.local.json
repo-hotspots.md
